# Title: SQLite Chromium Profile Data DB Access
# ID: 24c77512-782b-448a-8950-eddb0785fc71
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: TropChaud
# Date: 2022-12-19
# Tags: attack.credential-access, attack.t1539, attack.t1555.003, attack.collection, attack.t1005
# Description: Detect usage of the "sqlite" binary to query databases in Chromium-based browsers for potential data stealing.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((cmdline:*\\User Data\\* OR cmdline:*\\Opera Software\\* OR cmdline:*\\ChromiumViewer\\*)) AND ((cmdline:*Login Data* OR cmdline:*Cookies* OR cmdline:*Web Data* OR cmdline:*History* OR cmdline:*Bookmarks*)) AND ((Product:"SQLite") OR ((process_name:*\\sqlite.exe OR process_name:*\\sqlite3.exe))))
